<descript>
<abstract>
GOES-9 Satellite Images generated in near real-time by the NRL-Monterey
SeaSpace TeraScan receiving station.  Routine images are produced on
a nominal 1/2 hour update schedule.   Visible images are only
generated during local daylight hours.
</abstract>
<purpose>
These images are generated for research purposes by NRL-Monterey.
Additional products may be added at a future date.
</purpose>
</descript>
